title:  Media remote: Play/Pause, Next, Prev, Vol +/- for the phone, from the overview's Light Control widget [not yet tested on a unit]
desc:   Bluetooth HID consumer-control service; with Light Control on in Quick Status and no smart light connected, the light box becomes a Media box (|◀◀ ▶‖ ▶▶|, ♪− ♪+). Re-pair the phone after installing.
